Howard S Shubs <howard@shubs.net> wrote:

> ?  E 0040  0000.0045

Time of year clock misconfigured.

> ?  D 0050  0000.0005

Nonvolatile RAM misconfigured.

This two error should depend on a discarged internal battery. Keep the
VAX powered up a bit, and it should recharge. If this wouldn't happen,
replace it.

> ?  C 0080  0000.4001

Serial line controller fault, but this is OK if you have disconnected
keyboard and mouse to use a serial console.

> ?  6 80A1  0000.4001

SCSI-B controller on MSC module, you have nothing connected on the
second onboard SCSI interface.

> ?? 1 00C0  0000.7004

Ethernet circuits, you just have to connect an ethernet cable or a
transceiver.

Nothing seriuos, at last. :)

	diagnosticatamente,
	     Cthulhu

